  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">This Enabling Activity project will assist Brazil to prepare their Fifth National Communication (5NC), as well as their First, Second and Third Biennial Transparency Reports (BTR1, BTR2 and BTR3) required to meet obligations under the Transparency Agenda from UNFCCC (United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change). These reports will be submitted to the UNFCCC in 2024 (BTR1), 2026 (5NC and BTR2) and 2028 (BTR3).</narrative>
  </description>
